    <briefdescription>
<para>This is the ModuleSanitizerCoverage pass used in the new pass manager. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The pass instruments functions for coverage, adds initialization calls to the module for trace PC guards and 8bit counters if they are requested, and appends globals to llvm.compiler.used. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
